# Monorepo env overview
# Frontend: copy apps/web/.env.example -> apps/web/.env.local
# Backend:  copy apps/backend/.env.example -> apps/backend/.env

# Or keep a root .env for local convenience (some tools still read CWD).
# Prefer app-local env files going forward.

# See:
# - apps/web/.env.example
# - apps/backend/.env.example
